  titles:
  - Move and jump
  - Collect
  - Earn stars
  - Watch out
  texts:
  - 'Tap the arrows to walk left or right.

    Tap the jump button to jump.

    Tap again in the air to double jump.'
  - 'Walk into a rock or mineral to pick it up.

    Read its name and what it is.'
  - 'Reach the end to finish the level.

    See what you found and your stars.'
  - 'Jump over pits and traps.

    Finish before the timer runs out.'
  prevButton: {fileID: 2122002780}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1885952493}
